--- Summary of Round 1 ---
Tool `OpenAPI Explorer:getApiOverview` with Parameter {'id': 'openai'} on OpenAPI Explorer succeeded. Result (summarized from 5862 tokens): OpenAI API v2.3.0 overview (https://api.openai.com). Official docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference. 219 endpoints total. For endpoint summaries: https://oapis.org/summary/openai/[idOrRoute]. Endpoint specs live at https://oapis.org/openapi/openai/{endpointId}.

Key areas and endpoints:
- Assistants: listAssistants, createAssistant, getAssistant, modifyAssistant, deleteAssistant
- Audio (speech/ASR/translation): createSpeech, createTranscription, createTranslation
- Batches: listBatches, createBatch, retrieveBatch, cancelBatch
