- Text Completions: createCompletion
- Containers: ListContainers, CreateContainer, RetrieveContainer, DeleteContainer; files: ListContainerFiles, CreateContainerFile, RetrieveContainerFile, DeleteContainerFile, RetrieveContainerFileContent
- Conversation items: listConversationItems, createConversationItems, getConversationItem, deleteConversationItem
- Embeddings: createEmbedding
- Evals: listEvals, createEval, getEval, updateEval, deleteEval; runs: getEvalRuns, createEvalRun, getEvalRun, cancelEvalRun, deleteEvalRun; outputs: getEvalRunOutputItems, getEvalRunOutputItem
- Files: listFiles, createFile (upload), retrieveFile, deleteFile, downloadFile (content)
- Grader: runGrader, validateGrader
