- Responses:
  - 200 application/json: oneOf Private User or Public User objects; discriminator on user_view_type with mapping { public -> #/components/schemas/public-user, private -> #/components/schemas/private-user }.
    - Common user fields include: login, id (int64), user_view_type, node_id, avatar_url, gravatar_id (nullable), url, html_url, followers_url, following_url (templated), gists_url (templated), starred_url (templated), subscriptions_url, organizations_url, repos_url, events_url (templated), received_events_url, type, site_admin, name (nullable), company (nullable), blog (nullable), location (nullable), email (nullable), notification_email (nullable), hireable (nullable), bio (nullable), twitter_username (nullable), public_repos, public_gists, followers, following, created_at (date-time), updated_at (date-time), plan { collaborators, name, space, private_repos }.
