      - id (integer): unique identifier
      - slug (string): app slug
      - node_id (string)
      - client_id (string)
      - owner (one of):
        - Simple User: standard user fields (login, id, node_id, avatar_url, html_url, type, site_admin, urls for followers/following/gists/starred/subscriptions/orgs/repos/events/received_events; name/email nullable; gravatar_id nullable; user_view_type; starred_at)
