      - description (string, nullable)
      - external_url (uri)
      - html_url (uri)
      - created_at (date-time)
      - updated_at (date-time)
      - permissions (object): map of permission names to levels; example keys include issues, checks, metadata, contents, deployments; additionalProperties string; example: issues: read, deployments: write
      - events (array of string): list of subscribed events; installation_target, security_advisory, and meta are global and not included
      - installations_count (integer): number of installations; only returned when the integration requests details about itself
    - Required: id, node_id, owner, name, description, external_url, html_url, created_at, updated_at, permissions, events
