General
- OpenAPI version: 3.0.3
- API version: 1.1.4
- Title: GitHub v3 REST API
- License: MIT (https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT)
- Terms: https://docs.github.com/articles/github-terms-of-service
- Support: https://support.github.com/contact?tags=dotcom-rest-api
- Server: https://api.github.com
- Docs: https://docs.github.com/rest/ and method docs: https://docs.github.com/rest/apps/apps#create-an-installation-access-token-for-an-app

Endpoint
- Path: POST /app/installations/{installation_id}/access_tokens
- Tag: apps
- OperationId: apps/create-installation-access-token
- Purpose: Create an installation access token for a GitHub App’s installation on an org or user account.
- Auth: Must authenticate as the GitHub App using a JWT.
- Token expiration: 1 hour. Using an expired token returns 401 Unauthorized; create a new token.
- Repository access defaults: If no repositories or repository_ids are specified, token has access to all repos the installation can access.
- Scoping limits: You cannot grant access to repos the installation wasn’t granted. You can specify up to 500 repositories.
- Permissions defaults: If permissions are not specified, token gets all permissions granted to the app. You cannot request permissions the app wasn’t granted.

Parameters
- Path parameter: installation_id (integer, required). Example: 1.

Request body (application/json; optional)
- repositories: array of repository names to scope the token to. Example item: "rails".
- repository_ids: array of repository IDs to scope the token to. Example: [1].
- permissions: object specifying token permissions (cannot exceed app’s granted permissions). Allowed keys and values:
  - actions: read | write
  - administration: read | write
  - attestations: read | write
  - checks: read | write
  - codespaces: read | write
  - contents: read | write
  - dependabot_secrets: read | write
  - deployments: read | write
  - discussions: read | write
  - environments: read | write
  - issues: read | write
  - merge_queues: read | write
  - metadata: read | write
  - packages: read | write
  - pages: read | write
  - pull_requests: read | write
  - repository_custom_properties: read | write
  - repository_hooks: read | write
  - repository_projects: read | write | admin
  - secret_scanning_alerts: read | write
  - secrets: read | write
  - security_events: read | write
  - single_file: read | write
  - statuses: read | write
  - vulnerability_alerts: read | write
  - workflows: write
  - custom_properties_for_organizations: read | write
  - members: read | write
  - organization_administration: read | write
  - organization_custom_roles: read | write
  - organization_custom_org_roles: read | write
  - organization_custom_properties: read | write | admin
  - organization_copilot_seat_management: write
  - organization_announcement_banners: read | write
  - organization_events: read
  - organization_hooks: read | write
  - organization_personal_access_tokens: read | write
  - organization_personal_access_token_requests: read | write
  - organization_plan: read
  - organization_projects: read | write | admin
  - organization_packages: read | write
