Pre‑vetted shortlist (Downtown, Pike Place, Belltown, Pioneer Square)
Seafood & Pacific Northwest
- Elliott’s Oyster House — 1201 Alaskan Way, Pier 56 (waterfront classic for oysters and seafood; reservations recommended).
- Matt’s in the Market — Corner Market Building, Pike Place Market (intimate PNW spot with market views).
- The Pink Door — 1919 Post Alley (Italian‑American with seafood, lively atmosphere; hot reservation).
- Pike Place Chowder — 1530 Post Alley (casual, award‑winning chowders; great for lunch).

Sushi
- Sushi Kashiba — 86 Pine St, Suite 1 (omakase near Pike Place; book early or line up for counter).
- Shiro’s Sushi — 2401 2nd Ave (Belltown mainstay; classic Edomae).
- Umi Sake House — 2230 1st Ave (large menu, good for groups; popular late hours and happy hour).

Steak & Upscale American
- Metropolitan Grill — 820 2nd Ave (old‑school Seattle steakhouse).
- The Capital Grille — 1301 4th Ave (polished, reliable chain option downtown).

Italian & Pasta
- Tavolàta (Belltown) — 2323 2nd Ave (house‑made pastas; lively).
- Il Terrazzo Carmine — 411 1st Ave S (Pioneer Square; elegant, long‑time favorite).

Pan‑Asian & Other Standouts
- Wild Ginger — 1401 3rd Ave (Southeast Asian‑inspired; iconic downtown spot).
- Din Tai Fung (Pacific Place) — 600 Pine St, Level 4 (famous xiao long bao; expect waits without a booking).

Breakfast/Brunch
- Tilikum Place Cafe — 407 Cedar St (beloved for Dutch babies; book if you can).
- Bacco Cafe — 86 Pine St (popular breakfast near the Market).
- The Crumpet Shop — 1503 1st Ave (quick, uniquely Seattle).

Coffee (grab‑and‑go near downtown)
- Storyville Coffee (Pike Place Market) — 94 Pike St, top floor (cozy, views).
- Anchorhead Coffee — 1600 7th Ave, Suite 105 (creative drinks, great pastries).
- Caffè Umbria (Pioneer Square) — 320 Occidental Ave S (Italian‑style espresso bar; a short hop south of the core).

How we’ll finalize your best options
- Send your hotel name/address and your target meal times. I’ll:
  - Check “Open now” and today/tomorrow hours,
  - Confirm 4.0+ average ratings and skim most recent reviews,
  - Sort by walking distance and ETA from your hotel,
  - Share reservation/wait‑list links or good walk‑in options,
  - Provide a concise pick list by category (Seafood, Sushi, Steak, Italian, Brunch, Coffee).

