- Sushi near Belltown: https://www.google.com/maps/search/sushi+near+Belltown+Seattle

A couple of pro tips
- Prime spots (Sushi Kashiba, The Pink Door, Metropolitan Grill) book up; reservations help.
- Check for auto service charges (common in Seattle).
