- Risk factors—leaving hospital:
  - Younger age: adjOR 0.90 (95% CI 0.86–0.93; lower OR per year implies younger at higher risk).
  - Low colleague support: adjOR 3.18 (1.06–9.36).
  - Dissatisfied with job prospects: adjOR 2.38 (1.02–5.54).
  - Dissatisfied with overall work: adjOR 2.71 (1.09–6.69).
- Risk factors—leaving profession:
